WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.770
A thought can start small.

2
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.930
It doesn't have to stay that way.

3
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.710
Write a few words.

4
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:25.870
Talk it through.

5
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:30.710
Bring a link, a PDF, a photo, or the notes you already have.

6
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.710
Start wherever the idea really began.

7
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.630
Briopost shapes one idea for the way you want to share it.

8
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.270
A carousel that unfolds.

9
00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.930
A graphic that lands at a glance.

10
00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.510
A text post that sounds like you.

11
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.130
Or a poll that starts a conversation.

12
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.670
and you're not choosing from the same handful of layouts.

13
00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:06.850
There are 150 carousel designs and

14
00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.740
100 graphic designs.

15
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:19.390
Pick the one that fits the idea, then make it yours.

16
00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:31.730
Your colors, your type, your logo, your voice.

17
00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:38.570
Change the words, the pictures, the chart, the smallest detail until it feels like your own.

18
00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:54.330
Before Briopost's AI does anything, you see what it will cost.

19
00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.850
You plan the week in one place.

20
00:01:57.320 --> 00:02:00.550
Connect LinkedIn, choose the time, and give your OK.

21
00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:03.990
Briopost posts it only when you say so.

22
00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:17.510
One thought.

23
00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:19.390
Four ways to share it.

24
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.870
Make room for what comes next.

25
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.910
Join the Briopost beta.
